WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.997
Explain ways to conserve electricity and other forms of energy.

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:09.841
Energy powers lights and many tools we use. We save electricity by switching off

00:00:09.841 --> 00:00:14.104
lights and appliances when not needed and choosing efficient bulbs where possible.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.917
Adults should unplug or repair unsafe electrical equipment. Conserving energy reduces

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:23.078
waste and can help families manage costs.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.555
With an adult, make a home or classroom energy-saving checklist.
